aphic reference uses a different viewpoint.\n\nPHYSICAL PROPORTIONS, DO NOT INVENT EXTRA HEIGHT: eight-sided/octagonal1891 riveted lattice tower with EIGHT slender splayed supports, not a square four-legged Eiffel tower. Approximate hall flat-to-flat width22.5m and height7m, cream octagonal entrance hall with gray metal roof and delicate pierced steel arches. Lower gallery FLOOR at20m, NOT30m and NOT40percent of the tower's actual height. Lower floor should be near y952/1600=59.5percent of canvas height, with glass ring and diamond-lattice railing just above it. Slender tapering open blue-gray lattice with central narrow octagonal tube and twin spiral stairs. Upper glazed octagonal observation FLOOR at51m, NOT55m; at y673/1600=42.1percent of canvas height. Gray upper lantern roof/body top at58.7m, near y600/1600=37.5percent from top. Slender gray lattice antenna approximately12m above roof ends around71m, near y481/1600=30.1percent. These are the current corrected targets. The projected lower floor is roughly26percent of the tower's visible axis height ABOVE the ground; upper floor roughly70percent. Do not repeat the previous overly high lower gallery. The overall unprojected physical proportions are20/71 and51/71.\n\nNatural camera photograph appearance with subtle believable textures and natural muted daylight. Keep the good light blue-gray metal, cream octagonal hall, garden setting and material appearance. Neutral green spring/summer park with lawn, leafy trees well BEHIND and well to the SIDES of the whole tower, simple gravel paths and unremarkable sky. NO foreground tree, bush, foliage or grass covering ANY hall corner, support foot, gallery or mast. Every ground contact fully visible. No exact Prague buildings, skyline, churches, sculptures, temporary installations, brands, cars, people or signs. Red entrance panels are completely blank; green lanterns may be small. No HDR, saturated cinematic grading, miniature/diorama, plastic foliage or repeated stamped texture.\nVisible text: ONLY small unobtrusive lowercase “havainnekuva” in a lower corner. Do not render ANY guide label, other letter, numeral, logo, watermark or border. Output a single new full-color K1 v2 image, no contact sheet and no other angles.\n",
